  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/874/273/2024-05-25_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>災厄村民的風暴即將逼近....</p>\n<p>歡迎來到 Slash Illager</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組為 Slash Blade 的擴充模組，為災厄村民加入了 Slash Blade 大師……名為 Blade Master。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請勿靠近此敵人，否則你將被斬殺。就像你用 Slash Blade 砍殺生物一樣……</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請小心襲擊事件……</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">鳴謝</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Blade Master（又稱武士）出自我的模組 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bagus-mob\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bagus Mob</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Blade Master 模型來自 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Itz_BlueJacob</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">需求</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slashblade-resharped\" rel=\"nofollow\">Slash Blade Resharped</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\">Player Animator</a></span></p>",
